      <h1>How Taproot Changed Bitcoin</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">Taproot added a SegWit version 1 output type with two spending paths: a Schnorr-signature key path and a script path that reveals only the selected committed script branch. BIPs 340, 341, and 342 define separate parts of the system. Taproot improves flexibility, selective disclosure, and some transaction efficiency, but its benefits depend on the construction and software support used.</p>
      <ul class="msc-learn-page-meta"><li>Protocols</li><li>Deep</li><li>Protocol Explainer</li><li>17 to 20 minutes</li><li>Reviewed 2026-07-25</li></ul>
